181 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (While in every other state their governments strenuously supported the cause of their cancer centres, TN Government strained every nerve to demote ours sadly due to lack of awareness.  In the face of adversity, the resolve to forge ahead stayed unbroken.  )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
