/ActualText (The CMCHIS Department champions healthcare accessibility, handling pre-authorizations, claim filings, and coordination with insurance companies. Recognized as one of the Best Performing Hospitals under the Chief Minister's Health Insurance Scheme, they process nearly 800 claims monthly, covering various treatments. Their work goes beyond numbers, representing a commitment to providing quality healthcare for those in need.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
