/ActualText (Ms. Srividya and Ms. Padma supported by a team of two, their responsibilities are vast and impactful. In the earlier days, accounts, stores, and purchase worked hand-in-hand, handling nearly 800-900 purchase orders each month, totaling around five crores. Their scope has expanded to include online orders and the distribution of stationery across the institute.)
