/ActualText (Under the leadership of Ms. Gayathri, the Stores Department stands as the lifeline for procurement and distribution. With eleven dedicated individuals, including sub-stores at Dr. S. Krishnamurthi campus operating 24*7, they dispense medicines for nearly 1000 prescriptions, catering to about 250 patients per day.)
