/ActualText (Beyond the paperwork and statistics, the staff of these departments, just like the rest in the Institute, share a legacy with the late Chairman, Dr. V. Shanta. Their unwavering commitment has seen them through floods and pandemics, navigating challenges with resilience and fortitude.)
