/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The institute took a significant step , reinforcing our commitment to fostering continuous improvement, quality enhancement, and professional development among our staff.  the Lean Six Sigma methodology combines the principles of Six Sigma, focused on reducing process variation and enhancing control, with Lean principles that aim to eliminate waste, non-value-added processes, and promote work standardization and flow. The training emphasized the DMAIC \(Define, Measure, Analyze, Improve, and Control\) model, providing a comprehensive understanding of the methodologies.)
