/ActualText (The objective of this activity is to identify the tobacco smokers/chewers in the community aged above 45 years who use more than one pack a day, for lung cancer screening and provide cessation intervention. A total of 200 households have been surveyed so far in the communities and 16 tobacco users have been identified.)
