298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The average age of initiating tobacco use in Tamil Nadu is 15.4 years. In order to curtail premature deaths and disease burden due to non-communicable diseases, Cancer Institute has been organising numerous awareness programs in various government and private educational institutions. The objective of school awareness is to prevent the initiation of tobacco usage among school and college students to create tobacco-free educational institutions in the communities.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [8]
>>
