<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A generous and commendable CSR  initiative by RBL. Donating for the treatment of pediatric cancer patients, specifically focusing on girl children under 18 years with solid tumors, reflects a commitment to making a positive impact on the community. This kind of support can significantly contribute to the well-being and health of those in need.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It's important for companies to engage in social responsibility efforts that align with the needs of the society they operate in, and supporting healthcare initiatives, especially for vulnerable populations like pediatric cancer patients, is a meaningful way to do so.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
