409 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I embarked on my journey with the Institute in 1985, joining as an Assistant Biochemist in the Biochemistry Department. The Biochemistry Department, where I proudly contribute, operates tirelessly 24/7, exemplifying our commitment to excellence.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
410 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (From a facility with basic conveniences to an Institute standing shoulder to shoulder with leading corporate institutions, is a testament to the vision and dedication of our founders. Their unwavering leadership has played a pivotal role in elevating our institute to new heights.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
411 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Having dedicated 39 years of my life to this institution, my journey has been a remarkable one. Driven by the ethos instilled by Dr. Shanta and Dr. Krishnamurthi, I not only imbibed their teachings but also witnessed firsthand the profound impact our services have on society.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
412 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When Dr. Krishnamurthi interviewed me in 1985, I promised him stability and sincerity in my service. Today, I can proudly say that I have lived up to that promise. The invaluable life lessons I garnered from the founders and the institute - service, authenticity, and sincerity - have become my guiding principles, my life mantra.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
413 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (As I reflect on my journey, I extend my heartfelt gratitude to the institute. I am privileged to continue serving the community with unwavering dedication and commitment. The institute and its visionary leaders have not only shaped my life but have also instilled in me a profound sense of purpose and service.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
414 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Dr. R. Arivazhagan M.sc., Ph.D)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Professor & Head)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Department of Clinical Biochemistry )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Cancer Institute \(WIA\), Adyar)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I gratefully recall every visit to the Cancer Institute \(WIA\). 23 years ago where I was gently but firmly guided over five months through radiation and chemotherapy both of which had alarming side-effects. The doctors, support staff and admin were all extremely dignified and helpful. Through it all shone the energy and magnetism of the chairman herself, like a lamp burning brightly through the night : Dr. V Shanta's smile and starched saris continue to be the center of my emotional universe.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
419 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Survivor )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
420 0 obj
